            all          8         38    0.00216     0.0526     0.0587     0.0354    0.00216     0.0526     0.0607     0.0408\nSpeed: 0.1ms preprocess, 1.1ms inference, 0.0ms loss, 1.4ms postprocess per image\nResults saved to /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp\nPredicting over val dataset...\nEvaluate sequence:  /cache/ctc_preds/02  with ground truth:  /work/data/val/02/GTwith results:  {\'SEG\': 0.0}  done!\n[INFO] [SEQ 02] metrics={\'SEG\': 0.0, \'fitness\': 0.0}\nMETRICS: {\'fitness\': 0.0, \'SEG\': 0.0, \'per_seq\': {\'01\': {\'SEG\': 0.0, \'fitness\': 0.0}, \'02\': {\'SEG\': 0.0, \'fitness\': 0.0}}, \'n_seqs\': 2, \'eval_time_sec\': 104.9236261844635}\nExecution time: a minute (time limit is 2 hours).\n```'}], 'completion_text': '{\'summary\': "The program has a critical bug where the training hyperparameters are not being correctly applied. The code specifies training for 40 epochs with an image size of 1024 using the \'yolov8s-seg.pt\' model. However, the execution log shows that the \'yolov8n-seg.pt\' model was trained for only 2 epochs with an image size of 640. This insufficient training resulted in a completely ineffective model and a final SEG score of 0.0.", \'is_bug\': True, \'metric\': 0}'}]' 
