──── 13/22 7.3it/s 2.0s<1.2s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.668      2.031      2.326      1.132         44        640: 64% ━━━━━━━╸──── 14/22 7.4it/s 2.1s<1.1s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.675      2.065      2.334      1.137         40        640: 68% ━━━━━━━━──── 15/22 7.0it/s 2.3s<1.0s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.653      2.048      2.315      1.127         32        640: 73% ━━━━━━━━╸─── 16/22 6.9it/s 2.5s<0.9s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.653      2.037      2.303      1.126         48        640: 77% ━━━━━━━━━─── 17/22 6.8it/s 2.6s<0.7s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.652      2.031      2.295      1.129         43        640: 82% ━━━━━━━━━╸── 18/22 6.9it/s 2.7s<0.6s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.633      2.003      2.286      1.124         34        640: 86% ━━━━━━━━━━── 19/22 6.5it/s 2.9s<0.5s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.637      2.003      2.273      1.131         45        640: 91% ━━━━━━━━━━╸─ 20/22 6.7it/s 3.1s<0.3s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.627      2.002      2.267      1.127         38        640: 95% ━━━━━━━━━━━─ 21/22 6.6it/s 3.2s<0.2s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.627      2.002      2.267      1.127         38        640: 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 22/22 6.8it/s 3.2s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.627      2.002      2.267      1.127         38        640: 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 22/22 6.8it/s 3.2s', '\n', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 14.5it/s 0.1s', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 14.3it/s 0.1s', '\n', '                   all          8         38    0.00216     0.0526     0.0587     0.0354    0.00216     0.0526     0.0607     0.0408\n', '\n2 epochs completed in 0.002 hours.\n', 'Optimizer stripped from /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp/weights/last.pt, 6.8MB\n',