', 'Ultralytics 8.3.223 🚀 Python-3.12.8 torch-2.9.0+cu128 CUDA:0 (NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation, 48520MiB)\n', 'YOLOv8n-seg summary (fused): 85 layers, 3,258,259 parameters, 0 gradients, 11.3 GFLOPs\n', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 14.4it/s 0.1s', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 14.2it/s 0.1s', '\n', '                   all          8         38    0.00216     0.0526     0.0587     0.0354    0.00216     0.0526     0.0607     0.0408\n', 'Speed: 0.1ms preprocess, 1.1ms inference, 0.0ms loss, 1.4ms postprocess per image\n', 'Results saved to /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp\n', 'Predicting over val dataset...\n', 'Evaluate sequence:  /cache/ctc_preds/02  with ground truth:  /work/data/val/02/GT', "with results:  {'SEG': 0.0}  done!\n[INFO] [SEQ 02] metrics={'SEG': 0.0, 'fitness': 0.0}\n", "METRICS: {'fitness': 0.0, 'SEG': 0.0, 'per_seq': {'01': {'SEG': 0.0, 'fitness': 0.0}, '02': {'SEG': 0.0, 'fitness': 0.0}}, 'n_seqs': 2, 'eval_time_sec': 109.22539377212524}\n", 'Execution time: a minute (time limit is 2 hours).', '\n\n submission.csv Grader Feedback: Solution is valid']' 
